  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MAPBIOMAS: Land Use Change Monitoring</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MapBiomas is a multi-institutional initiative involving NGOs, universities, think-tanks and tech companies dedicated to map the land cover and land use (LCLU) changes of the Brazilian biomes to support and advance sustainable management and conservation of natural resources.</narrative>
  </description>
